
    Welcome to WraithOS
    ───────────────────
    Slot:         dual-slot A/B (RAUC-compatible)
    Orchestrator: http://127.0.0.1:9090/healthz
    Modules:      /modules  (persistent via /data)
    Config:       /etc/wraith/orchestrator.toml
    Logs:         /var/lib/orchestrator/wraith.log
    Watchdog:     /dev/watchdog  (nowayout=1, soft_margin=15)

    Update:       wraith-update /path/to/rootfs.squashfs
    Rollback:     rm /boot/boot_b && reboot

